#ASSERT `s 950(2) the thing is a form of co-operation` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 950(2) the thing is a form of co-operation` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 951(1) and (3): review and appeal as the rules specify (the rules are outside the sources).
